/*
 * Canonical language-word registry.
 *
 * PGY_LANGUAGE_KEYWORD(
 *     spelling, class, token identity, stable debug/word identity,
 *     grammar context mask, semantic axis, implementation support,
 *     tooling support, TextMate highlight scope)
 *
 * PGY_LANGUAGE_WORD_REGISTRY_ROWS is the stable owner marker for the complete
 * row set below. Rows are bytewise sorted by spelling because
 * lexer_lookup_keyword() uses binary search. The debug identity is a stable
 * symbol: native PgyLanguageWordId and self-host LanguageWordId are generated
 * from it, while the legacy token debug string is its stringized spelling.
 * Context, support, tooling, and highlight scope are declared projection
 * facts, not implementation-complete evidence. The generated implementation
 * inventory audits them against native/self-host selectors and fixtures.
 * HIGHLIGHT has exactly one non-NONE scope; every other row has NONE.
 * Contextual/soft rows use PGY_KEYWORD_TOKEN_NONE and remain identifiers in
 * the lexer while typed parser/tooling consumers may select their word ID.
 */

